      <DESCRIPTION>? Gaia EDR3 photometric BP/RP flux excess factor (corrected following Riello et al., 2021A&amp;A...649A...3R) (bp_rp_excess_corr)</DESCRIPTION>
      <VALUES null="NaN" />
